  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Trinket_items\" title=\"Category:Trinket items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Trinket.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pale_Lavender_Ioun_Stone\">Pale Lavender Ioun Stone</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #FFBBBB solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#FFBBBB;--bg-color-1-dark:#573F3F;--bg-color-2:#FFE4E1;--bg-color-2-dark:#3D2C2A;--header-color:#FFBBBB;--header-color-dark:#573F3F;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\">5\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Gem_Generic_Purple.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Gem_Generic_Purple.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Jewelry / Trinket\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">Trinket\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>, <a href=\"/page/Exclusive\" title=\"Exclusive\">Exclusive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Gem_(material)\" title=\"Gem (material)\">Gem</a>:</b> Items made of <b>gem</b> are generally extremely durable and have a very high <a href=\"/page/Hardness\" title=\"Hardness\">hardness</a>. Most commonly used to make trinkets and docents.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">22\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"450\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000420000</span>420<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dreamforge\" title=\"Dreamforge\">Dreamforge</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Suppressed_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suppressed Power\">Suppressed Power</a> Crafting\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Absorption\" title=\"Spell Absorption\">Spell Absorption</a> - 50 Charges (Recharged/Day: 15)<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Absorption\" title=\"Spell Absorption\">Spell Absorption</a>:</b> This effect absorbs harmful spells targeted at the wearer.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Pale_Lavender_Ioun_Stone_(unsuppressed).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Pale_Lavender_Ioun_Stone_%28unsuppressed%29.png/420px-Pale_Lavender_Ioun_Stone_%28unsuppressed%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"320\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Pale_Lavender_Ioun_Stone_%28unsuppressed%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>A pale lavender gem about 1 inch in diameter. The Stone has been upgraded and will no longer burn out and become useless when all the charges are expended. One charge is expended per spell level absorbed.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li>Unlike most trinkets, Ioun Stones have an actual visual effect on your character - a soft glow matching its color will slowly rotate around you.</li>\n<li>Differing from other sources, the spell absorption charges are drained in accordance with the level of the spell being cast. For example, if a level four spell is cast on to a character with this equipped, four charges will be removed. Also, this effect is multiplied by how many debuffs are caused by the spell being cast, such as three debuffs caused by a level four spell will cause twelve charges to be removed.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817223502\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.081 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.132 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2326/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17167/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4448/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n148.79%  166.259     32 Template:IO\n100.00%  111.741      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  111.741      1 -total\n 96.24%  107.542      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 50.66%   56.604      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 49.47%   55.281      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 48.30%   53.968      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 47.09%   52.618      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.08%   25.787      1 Template:Mat\n 22.46%   25.099      3 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:14703-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817223502 and revision id 633868. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Jewelry\n  | name                     = Pale Lavender Ioun Stone\n  | minlevel                 = 5\n  | type                     = Trinket\n  | slot                     = Trinket\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoA|1}}\n  | durability               = 30\n  | material                 = Gem\n  | hardness                 = 22\n  | basevalue                = 420 pp\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | epic                     = no\n  | quest                    = Dreamforge\n  | end reward               = \n  | turn in                  = \n  | chest                    = [[Suppressed Power]] Crafting\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Absorption|Spell|0|50|15}}\n  | crafting                 = \n  | craftingupgrade          = \n  | description              = A pale lavender gem about 1 inch in diameter. The Stone has been upgraded and will no longer burn out and become useless when all the charges are expended. One charge is expended per spell level absorbed.\n  | pic                      = Gem Generic Purple.png\n  | picdesc                  = Pale Lavender Ioun Stone (unsuppressed).png\n  | tips                     = \n* Unlike most trinkets, Ioun Stones have an actual visual effect on your character - a soft glow matching its color will slowly rotate around you.\n* Differing from other sources, the spell absorption charges are drained in accordance with the level of the spell being cast. For example, if a level four spell is cast on to a character with this equipped, four charges will be removed. Also, this effect is multiplied by how many debuffs are caused by the spell being cast, such as three debuffs caused by a level four spell will cause twelve charges to be removed.\n}}",
